  "notes": "Second quadruple from the same run as n89-eec2e43c042090883c04, reported on 2026-11-22 by a later slice of the same three-pool join over the cyclic group Z_89 (slice 2,0; the run record in the first source was written before this slice ran and does not list it). The skew first block is the same fixed block, invariant under the multiplier group of order 11; the other three blocks differ. This is a sample and not a census. The Goethals-Seidel matrix of these rows is a skew-Hadamard matrix of order 356."
